  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>22nd August 2015</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our photographer Stef Formica has been out and about in Bristol this week armed with her camera and capturing life throughout the city. Here’s a few shots of everyday Bristol life being lived by some of the individuals who make up this vibrant and diverse place we’re very happy to call home.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-11.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9263\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-11-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"bp-1\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-11-675x450.jpg 675w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-11-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-11-120x80.jpg 120w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-11.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-31.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9264\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-31-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"bp-3\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-31-675x450.jpg 675w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-31-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-31-120x80.jpg 120w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-31.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-9.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9268\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-